{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow James Bond as a young, resourceful and sometimes reckless recruit in MI6's training program, and discover an origin story of the world\u2019s most famous spy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a heroic act, young Naval air crewman James Bond is offered to join the newly revived Double 0 program. But when a mission to stop a rogue agent ends in tragedy, he must join forces with his reluctant mentor Greenway to expose a deep conspiracy and stop a looming coup at the heart of the State.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BECOME 007</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a new standalone, re-imagined James Bond origin story, and the events that lead an audacious young hero to become the best MI6 agent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/a5ebb0f93ae666179a3313ad207af9eb.poster.avif?t=1768472064\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/a5ebb0f93ae666179a3313ad207af9eb.webm?t=1768472064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/a5ebb0f93ae666179a3313ad207af9eb.mp4?t=1768472064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A THRILLING ESPIONAGE ADVENTURE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on missions in breathtaking locations, drive iconic vehicles, and dive into a cinematic adventure in pursuit of a rogue agent who\u2019s always one step ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/0d16a21121f31042db9b4a102ed3725e.poster.avif?t=1768472064\" width=1000 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/0d16a21121f31042db9b4a102ed3725e.webm?t=1768472064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/0d16a21121f31042db9b4a102ed3725e.mp4?t=1768472064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SPYING, YOUR WAY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go silent or go loud. Whether fighting with fists or firepower, using gadgets to infiltrate, or bluffing your way past guards, the approach is entirely up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/6a9da91fbfe553589fac0dadd275acd8.poster.avif?t=1768472064\" width=1000 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/6a9da91fbfe553589fac0dadd275acd8.webm?t=1768472064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/6a9da91fbfe553589fac0dadd275acd8.mp4?t=1768472064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WELCOME TO MI6</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills and replay your favorite missions with additional modifiers, for endless espionage fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/89d95455f8fb51a198f517ffa9ad53c6.poster.avif?t=1768472064\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/89d95455f8fb51a198f517ffa9ad53c6.webm?t=1768472064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/89d95455f8fb51a198f517ffa9ad53c6.mp4?t=1768472064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3768760?t=1768472064","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/e8704084c7339af80e412057d6d02972aff81c79/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768472064","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/8bf73c76b83912ff82bb9d549bd83f34af539ec4/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1768472064","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/8bf73c76b83912ff82bb9d549bd83f34af539ec4/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1768472064","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Pre-Purchase Offer</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/ac819cb3dcfd1ffb1642162bd0d43187.avif?t=1768472064\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras_big/ac819cb3dcfd1ffb1642162bd0d43187.avif?t=1768472064 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pre-order 007 First Light and elevate your espionage adventure with a free Deluxe Edition upgrade! Earn your number with outfits inspired by 007 memorabilia, go all gold blazing with the Gleaming Pack including 4 gadget skins, and unlock a new weapon skin, Agent\u2019s Mark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pre-Order 007 First Light and receive the Deluxe Edition Upgrade and 24 hour early access for free:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 outfits:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day of the Dead</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desert Explorer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silent Anchor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gentleman Operator</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon skin:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Agent\u2019s Mark</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gleaming Pack, including 4 gadget skins:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gleaming Lighter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gleaming Earphones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gleaming Dart Gun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gleaming Pen</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>Wishlist Milestones &amp; Rewards!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GET REWARDS FOR EACH WISHLIST MILESTONE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/9fbd53f660aa0a41cc644037337aae4f.avif?t=1768472064\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras_big/9fbd53f660aa0a41cc644037337aae4f.avif?t=1768472064 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mission is simple: rally together and unlock the wishlist milestones for 007 First Light. With every milestone reached, new in-game and community rewards are unlocked, adding style, sophistication, and a secret reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sign-up to IOI Account to claim the community unlocks. More wishlists unlocks collective rewards each time you reach a new tier.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow James Bond as a young, resourceful and sometimes reckless recruit in MI6's training program, and discover an origin story of the world\u2019s most famous spy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a heroic act, young Naval air crewman James Bond is offered to join the newly revived Double 0 program. But when a mission to stop a rogue agent ends in tragedy, he must join forces with his reluctant mentor Greenway to expose a deep conspiracy and stop a looming coup at the heart of the State.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BECOME 007</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a new standalone, re-imagined James Bond origin story, and the events that lead an audacious young hero to become the best MI6 agent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/a5ebb0f93ae666179a3313ad207af9eb.poster.avif?t=1768472064\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/a5ebb0f93ae666179a3313ad207af9eb.webm?t=1768472064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/a5ebb0f93ae666179a3313ad207af9eb.mp4?t=1768472064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A THRILLING ESPIONAGE ADVENTURE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on missions in breathtaking locations, drive iconic vehicles, and dive into a cinematic adventure in pursuit of a rogue agent who\u2019s always one step ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/0d16a21121f31042db9b4a102ed3725e.poster.avif?t=1768472064\" width=1000 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/0d16a21121f31042db9b4a102ed3725e.webm?t=1768472064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/0d16a21121f31042db9b4a102ed3725e.mp4?t=1768472064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SPYING, YOUR WAY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go silent or go loud. Whether fighting with fists or firepower, using gadgets to infiltrate, or bluffing your way past guards, the approach is entirely up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/6a9da91fbfe553589fac0dadd275acd8.poster.avif?t=1768472064\" width=1000 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/6a9da91fbfe553589fac0dadd275acd8.webm?t=1768472064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/6a9da91fbfe553589fac0dadd275acd8.mp4?t=1768472064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WELCOME TO MI6</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills and replay your favorite missions with additional modifiers, for endless espionage fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steam